            2257,
            1687
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "5. Videos of the complete course (taught in a real classroom).",
          "block_bbox": [
            520,
            1748,
            2312,
            1813
          ],
          "block_id": 8,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The course page has become a valuable link to the class, and a resource for the students.I am very optimistic about the potential for graphics with sound. The bandwidth for voiceover is low, and FlashPlayer is freely available. This offers a quick review (with active experiment),and the full lectures can be downloaded. I hope professors and students worldwide will fi nd these web pages helpful. My goal is to make this book as useful as possible with all the course material I can provide.\n",
